sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Tarayıcı (React)
    participant N as Nginx (TLS)
    participant A as Fastify API
    participant P as PostgreSQL

    B->>N: GET / (HTML, JS, CSS)
    N-->>B: index.html + bundle

    B->>N: OPTIONS /api/v1/devices<br/>Origin: https://gozcu.example.com
    N->>A: proxy_pass /v1/devices
    A-->>B: 204 + Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true<br/>Vary: Origin

    B->>A: POST /v1/auth/session
    A-->>B: Set-Cookie: __Host-aegis_session<br/>HttpOnly · Secure · SameSite=Strict

    B->>A: GET /v1/devices (credentials: include)
    A->>P: SELECT devices
    P-->>A: gerçek kayıtlar
    A-->>B: 200 devices · empty_state

    B->>A: GET /v1/events (credentials: include)
    A->>P: SELECT events
    P-->>A: gerçek kayıtlar
    A-->>B: 200 events · empty_state

    Note over B,A: 30 sn polling · AbortController ile iptal

    B->>B: Onay modalı (explicit_user_confirmation)
    B->>A: POST /v1/commands
    A-->>B: 202 kuyruğa alındı / 428 onay gerekli / 403 origin

    B->>B: devices=[] → Eşleşmiş cihaz yok<br/>incidents=[] → Gerçek olay kaydı yok
